#. 新しい世界とは、この階の事なのだろうな…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "This must be what he meant by a \"new world\"..."
msgstr ""

#. 詳しく調べてみる必要がありそうだ…
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I should probably take a really close look around..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…
#. 罰があるんだろうな…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. ボクらの様子を監視してるのか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're watching every single move we make...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ついつい時計を見上げてしまう…
#. 意味ないって知ってるのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know it's pointless, but I can't stop looking at the\n"
"clock.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間がずれていてもわからないし…
#. 嫌な気分だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if the time was wrong, I wouldn't have any way of\n"
"knowing. I really don't like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、ここもか…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I guess I shouldn't be surprised, but on the 2nd floor\n"
"too..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>窓には、鉄板のような物が
#. 打ち付けられている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The windows here have those same metal plates covering\n"
"them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だが、そこにはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が
#. 打ち付けられているのか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The windows here have those same metal plates covering\n"
"them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
